      "name": "theme-ui-review",
      "title": "At ingestion, and only at ingestion",
      "description": "Review graphical assets AS THEY ARE INGESTED, in the context of the website or app design they are for — accessibility, branding, languages — to determine what the assets and the UI will be. At ingestion only, by owner ruling; called from ingest-theme. Measures rather than asserts, and raises findings rather than fixing them.",
